;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\きしむドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong? You seem down today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's just... it's hot today. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's August already."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, you turned 20 the other day, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Happy birthday. I can't give you any present, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... thank you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Really, what's wrong?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"The day before yesterday, I met your lawyer, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>. I got called in."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I heard about how we're related. About <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
"If you were going to tell me, I wish it had been sooner."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's been 3 years already since <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> disappeared. 
{PAUSE ""}
I still worry about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
And on top of that, to hear we're real sisters..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Even I don't know what I want. 
{PAUSE ""}
Whether I want an apology from you, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, or an explanation."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, sorry. I know it's not that simple. 
{PAUSE ""}
The lawyer told me how <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> came to be adopted, too, even if only briefly."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'd actually meant to tell you myself today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But maybe I did ask the lawyer to do that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Sorry. Something this important, and I only half remember."</STYLE><PG>
"How did you feel about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was given up for adoption to the Niimura family. So now </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is a child of the Niimura family. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But still, it isn't something you can settle that neatly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I regretted giving her up, but not being able to call myself her mother was frustrating."</STYLE><PG>
"Did you care about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course I did. That's why, when </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> called me out to Megasawa City, I felt I had to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Now I finally understand how I feel. 
{PAUSE ""}
I think I wanted you to tell me, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, '<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> is important to me.' 
{PAUSE ""}
Because you never showed any sign of it at all, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Honestly, it was hard at first. I was letting go of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my own child</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, even if it was to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">my best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But she was so loved by the Niimuras, and she got along with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> too, and I think somewhere along the way my feelings settled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> adoption wasn't a mistake. That's how I came to feel."</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, if <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> comes back..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm-hm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Would it be all right for us to be sisters, too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think it would be fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't the kind of girl who'd decide </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is 'not her mother' over something like that, and </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> should be close in whatever way you two think is right."</STYLE><PG>
"Honestly, it still doesn't feel real that we're sisters. 
{PAUSE ""}
Is it okay if I tell <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> about this, too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That you're sisters?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think that's fine. </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, you're an adult now, so from here on, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, you should live the way you think best. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE><PG>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"For dragging you, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> around to suit me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If we'd made different choices, a different―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, you can't say things like that anymore. 
{PAUSE ""}
The past is the past. Let's think about what comes next."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What comes next... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When will I be able to get out...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Life imprisonment is a long time... 
{PAUSE ""}
But I'll be waiting. Believing that you'll come out someday, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">―Time is almost up.</STYLE><PG>
"Well, I'll come again."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay. Be careful going home."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\きしむドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
